{"channelId":"UCXcMutrwqVZIwAU2UO1xSSA","row":["Veterinary Rehabilitation & Pain Management",2,"Welcome to Veterinary Rehabilitation & Pain Management, located in Cary, NC. We specialize in applying physical rehabilitation techniques and pain management to dogs and cats who have physical limitations due to injury, neurologic disease, surgery, or chronic pain. We work with your regular veterinarian and any specialists to evaluate pain and functional deficits, then develop a treatment and exercise plan tailored specifically for your pet. Whether your goal is to compete in agility or just go for a walk around the block, we can help your pet back to a lifestyle without limitations.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCXcMutrwqVZIwAU2UO1xSSA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCXcMutrwqVZIwAU2UO1xSSA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:23.584Z","channelId":"UCXcMutrwqVZIwAU2UO1xSSA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"f705af00e85c7639af70e41c85a4521bbe0d4926626ad4c35040303185ecc78c","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"416149849bf75a317a21cf8f37e19165ad5a560311377c43a70740afdb7a0561"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCXcMutrwqVZIwAU2UO1xSSA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":2,"raw":"2 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCXcMutrwqVZIwAU2UO1xSSA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:23.584Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"physical therapist","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCXcMutrwqVZIwAU2UO1xSSA"]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biography_audience_review","reason":"简介上下文未证明本人与目标人群的关系；保留原记录，不猜测身份。","keywords":[],"role":"practitioner_self_report","excerpt":"Welcome to Veterinary Rehabilitation & Pain Management, loc